@api = http://localhost:5180/api

### 1. Usuario propietario
POST {{api}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Carlos", "lastName": "Gómez", "email": "carlos@correo.com", "phoneNumber": "809-555-0100", "identificationNumber": "001-1234567-1" }

### 2. Activar al propietario
POST {{api}}/users/1/activate

### 3. Perfil de proveedor particular y verificación
POST {{api}}/providers/individual
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1 }

###
POST {{api}}/providers/1/verify

### 4. Vehículo y publicación
POST {{api}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{ "providerId": 1, "brand": "Toyota", "model": "Corolla", "year": 2022, "licensePlate": "A123456", "color": "Blanco",
  "transmission": "Automatic", "fuelType": "Gasoline", "category": "Sedan", "mileage": 30000,
  "dailyRate": 3000, "estimatedCommercialValue": 1200000, "description": "Sedán en excelente estado" }

###
POST {{api}}/vehicles/1/publish

### 5. Arrendatario verificado
POST {{api}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "María", "lastName": "Santos", "email": "maria@correo.com", "phoneNumber": "829-555-0200", "identificationNumber": "402-7654321-2" }

###
POST {{api}}/users/2/activate

###
POST {{api}}/users/2/verify-renter

### 6. Reserva (ajusta las fechas a fechas futuras)
POST {{api}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehicleId": 1, "renterId": 2, "startDate": "2026-12-01T10:00:00", "endDate": "2026-12-04T10:00:00", "riskLevel": "Medium" }

### 7. Confirmar: crea el depósito dinámico
POST {{api}}/reservations/1/confirm

###
GET {{api}}/security-deposits/by-reservation/1

### 8. Registrar la retención confirmada por el proveedor de pagos
POST {{api}}/security-deposits/1/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{ "heldAmount": 41976, "paymentProviderReference": "PSP-0001" }

### 9. Inspección de entrega e inicio
POST {{api}}/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservationId": 1, "type": "Delivery", "mileage": 30000, "fuelLevelPercentage": 100 }

###
POST {{api}}/reservations/1/start

###
GET {{api}}/vehicles?brand=toyota&status=Active
